A partner and I are looking to conduct a project within ALSA for an undergraduate project course.  We both recently completed a
fairly intensive operating systems course, but have no experience with
sound-card drivers.  We plan to spend about 8 weeks on this project, and
basically would like to inquire about any possible projects, which, at the
end of the 8 weeks, could provide us with some results that we can
test and demonstrate.  We are inquiring because we're not
completely certain on how to guage the amount of work going into
sound-driver related projects.  We are open to any recommendations or
suggestions which would provide us with a project useful to the ALSA
community, without biting off more than we are able to chew within the
next 8 weeks.

Any input would be greatly appreciated.
